operands.script:2:1: run text is empty (to press Enter alone use "press enter")
operands.script:3:1: type text is not valid UTF-8 (a "\xHH" escape must form valid UTF-8 together with its neighbours; the file itself must be UTF-8)
operands.script:4:1: run text contains control character U+0007 (a quoted string can hold control characters, for example "\e[1m")
operands.script:8:1: mark label is empty (for example mark done)
operands.script:9:1: mark label contains control character U+001B (a quoted string can hold control characters, for example "\e[1m")
operands.script:10:1: wait pattern is empty (an empty pattern matches every screen; write the text to wait for)
operands.script:11:1: bad regular expression /(/ (missing closing ))
operands.script:12:1: bad regular expression /a(?=b)/ (invalid or unsupported Perl syntax near "(?=")
operands.script:13:1: bad duration "0s" (wait idle needs a duration greater than 0)
